@startuml "时序图 - 多人共享记账系统"
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

actor 记账成员 as Member
actor 管理员 as Admin
participant "前端界面" as UI
participant "接口层" as API
participant "记录服务" as RS
participant "幂等校验" as IG
participant "状态机校验" as SG
participant "统计服务" as SS
participant "结算服务" as SET
participant "关系数据库" as DB

== 成员提交记录 ==
Member -> UI: submitRecord(id, version, requestId)
UI -> API: POST /records/{id}/submit
API -> RS: submit(id, actor)
RS -> IG: dedupe(requestId)
IG --> RS: ok
RS -> SG: validateTransition(DRAFT, PENDING)
SG --> RS: allow
RS -> DB: updateStatus(PENDING)
RS -> DB: appendRecordTrace()
RS --> API: Record
API --> UI: 200 已提交
UI --> Member: 提示已提交等待管理员审核

== 审核与撤回并发 ==
Member -> UI: withdrawRecord(id)
UI -> API: POST /records/{id}/withdraw
API -> RS: withdraw(id, actor)
RS -> SG: validateTransition(PENDING, DRAFT)
SG --> RS: conflict
RS --> API: reject(REQ-036)
API --> UI: 409 记录状态已变更
UI --> Member: 提示记录状态已变更请刷新

== 管理员审核通过 ==
Admin -> UI: approveRecord(id)
UI -> API: POST /records/{id}/approve
API -> RS: approve(id, admin)
RS -> SG: validateTransition(PENDING, APPROVED)
SG --> RS: allow
RS -> DB: updateStatus(APPROVED)
RS -> SS: refreshStatistics()
SS --> RS: refreshed
RS --> API: Record
API --> UI: 200 审核通过
UI --> Admin: 提示已通过并已计入统计

== 管理员发起结算 ==
Admin -> UI: createSettlement()
UI -> API: POST /settlements
API -> SET: createSettlement(ledgerId, admin)
SET -> SS: listApprovedRecords()
SS --> SET: List<Record>
SET -> SET: calculateNetAmounts()
SET -> DB: saveSettlementSnapshot()
SET --> API: Settlement
API --> UI: 200 结算单已生成
UI --> Admin: 展示结算单与转账方案

== 成员确认或申诉 ==
Member -> UI: confirmOrAppeal(id)
UI -> API: POST /settlements/{id}/confirm
API -> SET: confirm(id, actor)
SET -> DB: updateSettlementStatus()
SET --> API: Settlement
API --> UI: 200
UI --> Member: 全部确认后显示已确认申诉后显示有争议
@enduml
